                "_type": "Diesel Product Detail",
                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-sunlesssea-failbettergames-s2-1200x1600-2f506585222e.jpg",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "Failbetter Games",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "Failbetter Games",
                    "description": "![Image 1](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-sunlesssea-failbettergames-g2-00-700x117-743f058f8c8c.jpg)\n\n# LOSE YOUR MIND. EAT YOUR CREW. DIE.\n\nSunless Sea is a Gothic Horror RPG with a focus on exploration, exquisite storytelling and frequent death.\n\n![Image 2](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-sunlesssea-failbettergames-g2-01-700x126-adcae3d1d46a.jpg)\n\n# Captain a Victorian steamship on a vast underground sea\n\nIf the giant crabs, sentient icebergs and swarms of bats don’t get you, madness and cannibalism certainly will. But that old black ocean beckons, and there’s loot for the brave souls who dare to sail her.\n\n![Image 3](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/59dbccb4-25fc-4a9d-856e-928d1a3d0ab5-700x126-605382ba4cc2.jpeg)\n\n# Seek out intriguing individuals for your crew\n\nHire unique officers like the Haunted Doctor and the Irrepressible Cannoneer. Each has a story to tell, if you can draw it out of them.\n\n![Image 4](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-sunlesssea-failbettergames-g2-03-700x126-a90dc9f0d9e6.jpg)\n\n# Stray from the gas-lamps of civilization\n\nLight and dark, terror and madness: spend too long on the wide, dark sea and your crew will grow fearful and eventually lose their sanity.\n\n![Image 5](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-sunlesssea-failbettergames-g2-04-700x126-a8d074c73179.jpg)\n\n# Carve a life for your captain in a cruel and unique world\n\nA deep, compelling world packed with 350,000+ words of stories and secrets. Find your father’s bones. Determine London’s destiny. Defy the gods of the deep sea.\n\n![Image 6](https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-sunlesssea-failbettergames-g2-05-700x126-e2ef8b413f7b.jpg)\n\n# Your captain will die.\n\nPass on resources from one generation to the next. Acquire a family home and a hoard of heirlooms. Build a legacy of zailors who braved the sea and lost - or, occasionally, won.\n\nFeatures\n- Beautiful, hand drawn art - castles of ice, prisons perched on lily pads, fog-shrouded lighthouses and the DAWN MACHINE.\n- Real-time combat against ships and Zee-beasts, spider-crewed dreadnoughts and sentient icebergs.\n- Upgrade your steamship with powerful engines, cannons and pneumatic torpedo guns. (Or buy a bigger, better ship.)\n- Trade or smuggle silk and souls, mushroom wine and hallucinogenic honey.",
                    "shortDescription": "LOSE YOUR MIND. EAT YOUR CREW. DIE. Take the helm of your steamship and set sail for the unknown! Sunless Sea is a game of discovery, loneliness and frequent death, set in the award-winning Victorian Gothic universe of Fallen London.",
